<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654942537" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngowahi Frasa Basa Inggris dadi Ekspresi Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655163394">Ing perangan sadurunge, kita nyathet simbol operasi aljabar lan ngowahi ekspresi lan persamaan dadi frasa lan ukara. Saiki prosese dibalik: frasa basa Inggris diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar. Simbol lan variabel sing wis dirembug bisa mbantu. Ing jalur iki ana padanan basa Jawa; frasa Inggris asline kasedhiya ing pranala pambandhing sumber. <link target-id="fs-id1170655166578"/> ngringkes simbol lan frasa kasebut.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655166578" aria-label="Tabel limang larik lan telung kolom. Irah-irahan kolom: Operasi, Frasa: padanan basa Jawa, lan Ekspresi. Larik panambahan nyathet a ditambah b, gunggung saka a lan b, a ditambahi b, b ditambahaké marang a, total saka a lan b, lan b ditambahake marang a; kabeh nuduhake a ditambah b. Larik pangurangan nyathet a kurang b, salisih saka a lan b, a disuda b, b dikurangaké saka a, lan b dijupuk saka a; kabeh nuduhake a dikurangi b. Larik ping-pingan nyathet a ping b lan asil ping-pingan saka a lan b; notasi a titik b, ab, a kurung b, lan kurung a kurung b. Ping pindho saka a ditulis 2a. Larik paran nyathet a dipara b, asil paran saka a lan b, rasio saka a lan b, lan b minangka pambagi kanggo a. Notasiné a tandha para b, a garis miring b, pecahan a ing ndhuwur b, lan para gapit kanthi b ing njaba lan a ing njero.">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Frasa: padanan basa Jawa</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
gunggung saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahi <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> ditambahaké marang <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math><newline/>
total saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> kurang <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
salisih saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> disuda <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> dikurangaké saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> ping <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
asil ping-pingan saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
ping pindho saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline/><newline/>
2<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
asil paran saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
rasio saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> minangka pambagi kanggo <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655190784">Ing ngisor iki ana frasa kanggo patang operasi; susunan operandé kudu digatèkké kanthi tliti:</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655105929" alt="Gambar sumber Inggris ngemot patang frasa: “the sum of a and b”, “the difference of a and b”, “the product of a and b”, lan “the quotient of a and b”. Ing saben frasa, rerangken “of a and” awarna abang, kalebu aksara a ing tengah. Tegesé yaiku gunggungé a lan b, salisihé a lan b, asil ping-pingané a lan b, lan asilé a dipara b.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_015_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655227649">Saben frasa nemtokaké operasi lan susunan rong operand. Ing frasa Inggris, tembung <emphasis effect="italics">of</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">and</emphasis>  digunakaké kanggo nemtokaké rong operand lan urutané.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655354222">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655354224">
<problem id="fs-id1170655355492">
<para id="fs-id1170655355494">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil paran saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655117312">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<list id="fs-id1166425197914" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Tembung kuncine yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“difference” (salisih)</emphasis>, sing nuduhake operasi pangurangan. Ing frasa Inggris, tembung <emphasis effect="italics">of</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">and</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo nemtokaké wilangan wiwitan lan wilangan sing dijupuk saka iku.<newline/>
<media id="fs-id1170655127844" alt="Ing gambar sumber ana telung larik. Larik kapisan: “the difference of 17x and 5”, kanthi “of” lan “and” awarna abang. Larik kapindho: “17x minus 5”. Larik katelu: 17x − 5. Sing dikurangi yaiku 17x, banjur 5 dikurangaké saka 17x.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_016_img_new.jpg"/>
</media><newline/><newline/></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Tembung kuncine “quotient” (asil paran), sing nuduhake operasi paran.</item>
</list>
<media id="fs-id1170655111048" alt="Ing gambar sumber ana telung larik: “the quotient of 10x squared and 7”, kanthi “of” lan “and” awarna abang; banjur “divide 10x squared by 7”; pungkasane 10x² ÷ 7. Sing dipara yaiku 10x² lan pambaginé 7.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_018_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1167265670725">Iki uga bisa ditulis <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>utawa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655163327" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655163331">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163333">
<para id="fs-id1170655208557">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan 13 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil paran saka 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 2.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655215532">
<para id="fs-id1170655215534"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655351939" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655161309">
<problem id="fs-id1170655161311">
<para id="fs-id1170655161313">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> gunggung saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil ping-pingan saka <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655106926">
<para id="fs-id1170655106928"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 7<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655207371">Umur wolung taun sabanjuré ditemtokaké kanthi nambahaké 8 marang umur saiki; mula frasa Inggris “eight more than” nuduhake operasi nambah 8. Umur pitung taun sadurungé ditemtokaké kanthi njupuk 7 saka umur saiki; mula “seven less than” nuduhake operasi njupuk 7 saka umur saiki. Iki dudu pratelan pambandhing.</para>

<example id="fs-id1170655207375">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655166193">
<problem id="fs-id1170654972284">
<para id="fs-id1170654972286">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> Pitulas ditambahaké marang <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> Sanga dikurangaké saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655229585">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<list id="fs-id1166424865853" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Tembung kuncine yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“more than”.</emphasis> Tembung kasebut nuduhake panambahan. <emphasis effect="italics">“More than”</emphasis> tegese “ditambahake marang”.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424900029" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Pitulas ditambahaké marang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Pitulas ditambahake marang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Tembung kuncine yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“less than”</emphasis>. Tembung kasebut nuduhake pangurangan. <emphasis effect="italics">“Less than”</emphasis> tegese “dijupuk saka”.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424997640" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mtext>Sanga dikurangaké saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mtext>Sanga dijupuk saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
</list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655204422" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655204426">
<problem id="fs-id1170655204428">
<para id="fs-id1170655204430">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sewelas ditambahaké marang <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> Patbelas dikurangaké saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655200450">
<para id="fs-id1170655200452"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655164739" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655164744">
<problem id="fs-id1170655164746">
<para id="fs-id1170655164748">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 13 ditambahaké marang <emphasis effect="italics">z</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 18 dikurangaké saka 8<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655129023">
<para id="fs-id1170655129025"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>z</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655104992">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655104994">
<problem id="fs-id1170655104997">
<para id="fs-id1170655104999">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> lima ping gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> gunggung saka lima ping <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655190682">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655114108">Ana rong tembung operasi: <emphasis effect="italics">“times” (ping)</emphasis> nuduhake operasi ping-pingan, dene <emphasis effect="italics">“sum” (gunggung)</emphasis> nuduhake panambahan.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424761248" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Amarga frasa iki ateges 5 ping sakabehing gunggung, tandha kurung kudu ngapit gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Mula, gunggung kasebut kudu ditemtokake dhisik. Elinga urutan operasi.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166420322683" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>lima ping gunggung saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Kanggo nemtokaké gunggung, tembung Inggris “of” lan “and” nuduhake apa sing ditambahaké. Ing kéné, gunggung kasebut dumadi <emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis> lima ping <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424760024" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>gunggung</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lima ping</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
</list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655171042" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655177754">
<problem id="fs-id1170655177756">
<para id="fs-id1170655177758">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> papat ping gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> gunggung saka papat ping <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655197238">
<para id="fs-id1170655197241"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654989451" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655113787">
<problem id="fs-id1170655113789">
<para id="fs-id1170655113791">Padanan basa Jawa ing ngisor iki diowahi dadi ekspresi aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pamanding sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka loro ping <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 8, <span class="token">ⓑ</span> loro ping salisih saka <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 8.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655157598">
<para id="fs-id1170655099451"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655121539">Mengko ing piwulang iki, kaprigelan aljabar bakal digunakake kanggo ngrampungake masalah terapan. Langkah kapisan yaiku ngowahi frasa dadi ekspresi aljabar. Rong tuladha sabanjure nuduhake carane.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655121545"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121547">
<problem id="fs-id1170655121549">
<para id="fs-id1170655120589">Ambané pasagi dawa yaiku dawané dikurangi 6. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">l</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili dawané pasagi dawa. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo ambané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655162128">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-72" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel papat larik lan rong kolom tanpa irah-irahan. Kolom kiwa ngemot langkah, kolom tengen ngemot frasa utawa ekspresi. Ambané pasagi dawa padha karo dawané dikurangi 6. Dawané diwakili aksara l. Frasa “6 less than l” tegesé 6 dijupuk saka l, mula ekspresiné l − 6.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen frasa bab ambané pasagi dawa.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “6 less than the length”</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunakna <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math> kanggo makili “dawane”.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “6 less than” nganggo  <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen maneh frasa Inggris “less than” minangka operasi “dikurangaké saka”; operand ing sisih tengen frasa dadi wilangan wiwitan.</entry>
    <entry>6 dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa kasebut dadi aljabar.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table>

</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1170655332442" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655332446">
<problem id="fs-id1170655332449">
<para id="fs-id1170655190394">Dawané pasagi dawa yaiku ambané dikurangi 7. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">w</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili ambané pasagi dawa. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo dawané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655190404">
<para id="fs-id1170654937336"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655270004" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655270008">
<problem id="fs-id1170655270010">
<para id="fs-id1170655270012">Ambané pasagi dawa yaiku dawané dikurangi 6. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">l</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili dawané pasagi dawa. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo ambané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655207305">
<para id="fs-id1170655207307"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655189882"><exercise id="fs-id1170655189045">
<problem id="fs-id1170655189047">
<para id="fs-id1170655189049">June duwé koin AS sepuluh sen sing diarani dime lan koin seprapat dolar, yaiku 25 sen, sing diarani quarter. Cacah dime yaiku papat ping cacah quarter banjur dikurangi 3. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili cacah koin quarter. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655352055">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-470" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel papat larik lan rong kolom tanpa irah-irahan. Kolom kiwa ngemot langkah, kolom tengen ngemot frasa utawa ekspresi. Frasa Inggris “3 less than 4 times the number of quarters” nemtokaké operasi: cacah quarter diwakili q, 4 ping q ditulis 4q, banjur 3 dikurangaké saka 4q. Mula cacah dime yaiku 4q − 3.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen frasa bab cacah dime.</entry>
    <entry>telu dikurangaké saka papat ping cacah koin quarter</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunakna <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math> digunakaké kanggo makili cacah quarter.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “3 less than 4 times” nganggo q; operasiné 3 dikurangaké saka 4 ping  <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa “4 ping <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math>”.</entry>
    <entry>3 dikurangaké saka <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa kasebut dadi aljabar.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170654919848" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654919852">
<problem id="fs-id1170654919854">
<para id="fs-id1170654919856">Geoffrey duwé koin AS sepuluh sen sing diarani dime lan koin 25 sen sing diarani quarter. Cacah dime yaiku papat ping cacah quarter banjur dikurangi 8. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili cacah koin quarter. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655195241">
<para id="fs-id1170655195243"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655020555" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655020559">
<problem id="fs-id1170655020561">
<para id="fs-id1170655020563">Lauren duwé koin AS sepuluh sen sing diarani dime lan koin lima sen sing diarani nickel. Cacah dime yaiku pitung ping cacah nickel banjur ditambah 3. Aksara <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> digunakaké kanggo makili cacah koin nickel. Tulisen ekspresi kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654940350">
<para id="fs-id1170654940352"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>